sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as App<br/>(flows.py listener)
    participant Webex as Webex (mock :8147)
    actor User
    App->>Webex: POST /v1/webhooks<br/>{"targetUrl": ".../webhook-listener", "resource": "messages", "event": "created"}
    Webex-->>App: 200 OK {"id": "hook-1", "status": "active"}
    Note over App: idle: no polling
    User->>Webex: POST /v1/messages {"text": "edge1 is down"}
    Webex-->>User: 200 OK {"id": "msg-1"}
    Webex->>App: POST /webhook-listener<br/>{"id": "msg-1", "roomId": "room-1", "personEmail": ...}
    App-->>Webex: 200 OK (ack fast)
    App->>Webex: GET /v1/messages/msg-1<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...
    Webex-->>App: 200 OK {"text": "edge1 is down"}
